RENDERED LENGTH — DETERMINISTIC, MEASURED IN LINES AGAINST THE ACTUAL RENDERER:
Estimated lines: {{ $json.layout.estimated_lines }} / budget {{ $json.layout.line_budget }} (estimated {{ $json.layout.estimated_pages }} pages)
